## Model Performance

The project uses forecasting models to predict item-level and store-level demand.

### LightGBM Results

The LightGBM model was evaluated using Mean Absolute Error (MAE) and Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE).

| Metric | Result |
|---|---:|
| MAE | 0.0413 |
| RMSE | 0.8601 |

The model generates forecasts at the item and store level and can support inventory planning and replenishment decisions.

### Forecast Output

The final forecast output contains:

- `item_id` – Product identifier
- `store_id` – Store identifier
- `ds` – Forecast date/day
- `y` – Actual/forecast demand value

This output can be used to compare predicted demand with actual sales and identify products that may require inventory attention.
